[&"", &"Palms open the southern gate"]: [&"Palms open the southern gate"],
[&"", &" Natural-weapon fumbles are adjudicated by the GM."]: [&" Natural-weapon fumbles are adjudicated by the GM."],
[&"", &"Shared doses for the two generated decoctions. Allocate at the table; unused decoctions lose vitality after 24 hours. Track eligibility and expiry manually."]: [&"Shared doses for the two generated decoctions. Allocate at the table; unused decoctions lose vitality after 24 hours. Track eligibility and expiry manually."],
[&"", &"Vomit for d4 hours. Pass a DR14 test or do nothing else. The source does not select an ability; the table adjudicates it and tracks the effect."]: [&"Vomit for d4 hours. Pass a DR14 test or do nothing else. The source does not select an ability; the table adjudicates it and tracks the effect."],
[&"", &"Snort to go berserk: two attacks per round, defence DR14 for one fight. Causes sneezing. Track the effects manually."]: [&"Snort to go berserk: two attacks per round, defence DR14 for one fight. Causes sneezing. Track the effects manually."],
[&"", &"See in darkness and climb walls for 30 minutes. Handle these benefits manually."]: [&"See in darkness and climb walls for 30 minutes. Handle these benefits manually."],
[&"", &"See in darkness and climb on walls for 30 minutes. Track the effects manually."]: [&"See in darkness and climb on walls for 30 minutes. Track the effects manually."],
[&"", &"Pass a DR14 test or suffer severe hallucinations for d4 hours. The source does not select an ability; the table adjudicates it and tracks the effect."]: [&"Pass a DR14 test or suffer severe hallucinations for d4 hours. The source does not select an ability; the table adjudicates it and tracks the effect."],
[&"", &"Toughness DR12 or lose d10 HP."]: [&"Toughness DR12 or lose d10 HP."],
[&"", &"Toughness DR14 or lose d6 HP and become blind for one hour. Track blindness manually."]: [&"Toughness DR14 or lose d6 HP and become blind for one hour. Track blindness manually."],
[&"", &"Dab the translucent oil into the eye: cures infection and gives +2 on Presence tests for d4 hours. Track the benefit manually."]: [&"Dab the translucent oil into the eye: cures infection and gives +2 on Presence tests for d4 hours. Track the benefit manually."],
[&"", &"Heals d6 HP and stops infection. May be habit-forming."]: [&"Heals d6 HP and stops infection. May be habit-forming."],
[&"", &"Against undead, lesser trolls and goblins, check Morale, adding or subtracting the Priest’s Presence modifier, to see whether they bow and leave."]: [&"Against undead, lesser trolls and goblins, check Morale, adding or subtracting the Priest’s Presence modifier, to see whether they bow and leave."],
[&"", &"Cast the stones to reveal danger in an adjacent room. The stones may lie: test Presence DR10 for truth; after failure, cannot test again until sunset. Track the restriction manually."]: [&"Cast the stones to reveal danger in an adjacent room. The stones may lie: test Presence DR10 for truth; after failure, cannot test again until sunset. Track the restriction manually."],
[&"", &"Read once per day and roll a die. Even: PCs heal d4 HP after five minutes of rest for the rest of the day. Odd: the GM invents d3 hallucinations only the Priest sees until sunrise. Resolve effects and duration manually."]: [&"Read once per day and roll a die. Even: PCs heal d4 HP after five minutes of rest for the rest of the day. Odd: the GM invents d3 hallucinations only the Priest sees until sunrise. Resolve effects and duration manually."],
[&"", &"Presence DR10 reveals evil creatures in strange light. The owner defends with +2 against beings discovered this way. Track the benefit manually."]: [&"Presence DR10 reveals evil creatures in strange light. The owner defends with +2 against beings discovered this way. Track the benefit manually."],
[&"", &"While worn, defence DR10. Pulled over the ears outside battle, nearly invisible: stealth DR8."]: [&"While worn, defence DR10. Pulled over the ears outside battle, nearly invisible: stealth DR8."],
[&"", &"A human-bone crook inscribed with anti-prayers that hooks through other worlds. Staff deals 2d4 damage except to faithless humans."]: [&"A human-bone crook inscribed with anti-prayers that hooks through other worlds. Staff deals 2d4 damage except to faithless humans."],
[&"", &"Once per day, sound the horn and test Presence DR12. One creature may make its next non-combat test an automatic success. Track the benefit manually."]: [&"Once per day, sound the horn and test Presence DR12. One creature may make its next non-combat test an automatic success. Track the benefit manually."],
[&"", &"A poisoned dagger in a silk-lined, snakeskin-bound sandalwood box. d4 damage; on a damage roll of 1, deadly poison kills the target immediately."]: [&"A poisoned dagger in a silk-lined, snakeskin-bound sandalwood box. d4 damage; on a damage roll of 1, deadly poison kills the target immediately."],
[&"", &"Cowardly guardian of the cursed sword Eurekia. Once per combat, if Hamfund can be found, draw Eurekia: 2d6 damage. Roll d6 for each swing; on 1 Hamfund dies and Eurekia vanishes forever. Track this at the table."]: [&"Cowardly guardian of the cursed sword Eurekia. Once per combat, if Hamfund can be found, draw Eurekia: 2d6 damage. Roll d6 for each swing; on 1 Hamfund dies and Eurekia vanishes forever. Track this at the table."],
[&"", &"A magical, intelligent, arrogant talking horse. If persuaded to care, occasionally adds +2 to Presence tests involving logic and intellect. The table adjudicates the benefit."]: [&"A magical, intelligent, arrogant talking horse. If persuaded to care, occasionally adds +2 to Presence tests involving logic and intellect. The table adjudicates the benefit."],
[&"", &"For the first two combat rounds, you and your allies gain +2 on attack/defence. Track the benefit manually."]: [&"For the first two combat rounds, you and your allies gain +2 on attack/defence. Track the benefit manually."],
[&"", &"A magical talking sword, foppish and unreliable. Attack/defence DR10, d6+1 damage. If continually disappointed, it develops a 1-in-6 chance to attack you or your companions; the table adjudicates this."]: [&"A magical talking sword, foppish and unreliable. Attack/defence DR10, d6+1 damage. If continually disappointed, it develops a 1-in-6 chance to attack you or your companions; the table adjudicates this."],
[&"", &"Loyal only to its Hermit, who understands its cries. Keeps watch, scouts and attacks."]: [&"Loyal only to its Hermit, who understands its cries. Keeps watch, scouts and attacks."],
[&"", &"A crafty, almost-intelligent hawk is loyal only to you. You understand its cries as it watches, scouts and attacks. Attack and defence DR10; claws/bite d4; HP 8."]: [&"A crafty, almost-intelligent hawk is loyal only to you. You understand its cries as it watches, scouts and attacks. Attack and defence DR10; claws/bite d4; HP 8."],
[&"", &"Music from your harp gives +d4 on reaction rolls."]: [&"Music from your harp gives +d4 on reaction rolls."],
[&"", &"Once per day summon d2 scrolls, each usable once. Roll d4: 1–2 sacred, 3–4 unclean. Unused scrolls turn to ash at sunrise. Resolve summons and track uses and expiry manually."]: [&"Once per day summon d2 scrolls, each usable once. Roll d4: 1–2 sacred, 3–4 unclean. Unused scrolls turn to ash at sunrise. Resolve summons and track uses and expiry manually."],
[&"", &"Twice per day, lower the DR of a chosen creature’s next test by 4. Track uses and the benefit manually."]: [&"Twice per day, lower the DR of a chosen creature’s next test by 4. Track uses and the benefit manually."],
[&"", &"Read once per day. An enemy tests DR12 to prevent it; on failure, d2 Berserker-slayers appear. Roll d6: 1–4 they fight alongside you; 5–6 they try to kill you and destroy the book. They return to imprisonment after battle. Resolve the summons and duration at the table."]: [&"Read once per day. An enemy tests DR12 to prevent it; on failure, d2 Berserker-slayers appear. Roll d6: 1–4 they fight alongside you; 5–6 they try to kill you and destroy the book. They return to imprisonment after battle. Resolve the summons and duration at the table."],
[&"", &"Know the right way with a Presence DR8 test."]: [&"Know the right way with a Presence DR8 test."],
[&"", &"The ruins of the Shadow King’s manse, thick with memories."]: [&"The ruins of the Shadow King’s manse, thick with memories."],
[&"", &"The old frozen ruins not far from Alliáns."]: [&"The old frozen ruins not far from Alliáns."],
[&"", &"The illegal midnight markets of Schleswig."]: [&"The illegal midnight markets of Schleswig."],
[&"", &"The heretic isle of Crëlut, two nautical miles east of Grift."]: [&"The heretic isle of Crëlut, two nautical miles east of Grift."],
[&"", &"Awakening, adult, in a ritual circle underneath the northern bridge to Grift."]: [&"Awakening, adult, in a ritual circle underneath the northern bridge to Grift."],
[&"", &"A little witches cottage in Galgenbeck."]: [&"A little witches cottage in Galgenbeck."],
[&"", &"Secret Bergen Chrypt church."]: [&"Secret Bergen Chrypt church."],
[&"", &"One of the many Graven-Tosk thief-tunnels."]: [&"One of the many Graven-Tosk thief-tunnels."],
[&"", &"Temple ruins in the Valley of the Unfortunate Undead."]: [&"Temple ruins in the Valley of the Unfortunate Undead."],
[&"", &"The crypts of Grift."]: [&"The crypts of Grift."],
[&"", &"Massacred Alliáns cult, sole survivor."]: [&"Massacred Alliáns cult, sole survivor."],
[&"", &"Galgenbeck, near the cathedral of the Two-Headed Basilisks."]: [&"Galgenbeck, near the cathedral of the Two-Headed Basilisks."],
[&"", &"Two young princes were kidnapped west of Bergen Chrypt."]: [&"Two young princes were kidnapped west of Bergen Chrypt."],
[&"", &"Anthelia demanded a gift of noble blood."]: [&"Anthelia demanded a gift of noble blood."],
[&"", &"The southern empire of Südglans sank into the sea."]: [&"The southern empire of Südglans sank into the sea."],
[&"", &"King Fathmu IX’s brother Zigmund, your father, was murdered."]: [&"King Fathmu IX’s brother Zigmund, your father, was murdered."],
[&"", &"Your caravan kingdom of Tveland fell into penury."]: [&"Your caravan kingdom of Tveland fell into penury."],
[&"", &"Your Wästland palace was reduced to rubble."]: [&"Your Wästland palace was reduced to rubble."],
[&"", &"Raised on a lonely island in Lake Onda; no one else has heard of it and you cannot return."]: [&"Raised on a lonely island in Lake Onda; no one else has heard of it and you cannot return."],
[&"", &"Wandered, memoryless, from the mouth of a cavern at the cliffs of Terion."]: [&"Wandered, memoryless, from the mouth of a cavern at the cliffs of Terion."],
[&"", &"Single child survivor of an incident in the Valley of the Unfortunate Undead."]: [&"Single child survivor of an incident in the Valley of the Unfortunate Undead."],
[&"", &"Dying of plague in a Bergen Chrypt hovel, you touched something from outside."]: [&"Dying of plague in a Bergen Chrypt hovel, you touched something from outside."],
[&"", &"Calm isolation in the Sarkash dark."]: [&"Calm isolation in the Sarkash dark."],
[&"", &"An average individual until you encountered something in a dim glade in Sarkash."]: [&"An average individual until you encountered something in a dim glade in Sarkash."],
[&"", &"Carry a portable laboratory. Daily materials allow two random decoctions and a total of d4 doses. Unused decoctions lose vitality after 24 hours; track eligibility and expiry manually."]: [&"Carry a portable laboratory. Daily materials allow two random decoctions and a total of d4 doses. Unused decoctions lose vitality after 24 hours; track eligibility and expiry manually."],
[&"", &"May use Powers while wearing medium armor."]: [&"May use Powers while wearing medium armor."],
[&"", &"Tough as wood: Toughness 3d6+2. Low in protein: Strength 3d6−2."]: [&"Tough as wood: Toughness 3d6+2. Low in protein: Strength 3d6−2."],
[&"", &"Begin with two independently rolled gifts."]: [&"Begin with two independently rolled gifts."],
[&"", &"Painfully average: no ability adjustments. Roll d8 for weapons and d4 for armor; reroll heavy armor."]: [&"Painfully average: no ability adjustments. Roll d8 for weapons and d4 for armor; reroll heavy armor."],
[&"", &"Begin with ordinary equipment plus one random sacred or unclean scroll."]: [&"Begin with ordinary equipment plus one random sacred or unclean scroll."],
[&"", &"Insightful: Presence 3d6+2. Frail: Strength 3d6−2. Roll d8 for weapons."]: [&"Insightful: Presence 3d6+2. Frail: Strength 3d6−2. Roll d8 for weapons."],
[&"", &"On death, if survival is at all possible, there is a 50% chance you survived. After 10 rounds return with d4 HP and an unlikely explanation. Resolve and track this manually."]: [&"On death, if survival is at all possible, there is a 50% chance you survived. After 10 rounds return with d4 HP and an unlikely explanation. Resolve and track this manually."],
[&"", &"When hidden in muck, debris and filth, noticing you requires Presence DR16. Resolve observers\' tests manually."]: [&"When hidden in muck, debris and filth, noticing you requires Presence DR16. Resolve observers\' tests manually."],
[&"", &"When hidden in muck, debris and filth, noticing you requires Presence DR16."]: [&"When hidden in muck, debris and filth, noticing you requires Presence DR16."],
[&"", &"Each Omen use has a 50% chance not to spend it. Resolve the chance and Omen benefit manually, using ordinary dice and sheet corrections. No Omen benefit is automated."]: [&"Each Omen use has a 50% chance not to spend it. Resolve the chance and Omen benefit manually, using ordinary dice and sheet corrections. No Omen benefit is automated."],
[&"", &"Each Omen use has a 50% chance not to spend it. Resolve and track this benefit manually."]: [&"Each Omen use has a 50% chance not to spend it. Resolve and track this benefit manually."],
[&"", &"Spit d2 times per fight at short range with Presence DR8. Targets are blinded, retching and vomiting for d4 rounds. Witnesses test Toughness to avoid vomiting: PCs DR10, enemies DR12. Track effects and rounds manually."]: [&"Spit d2 times per fight at short range with Presence DR8. Targets are blinded, retching and vomiting for d4 rounds. Witnesses test Toughness to avoid vomiting: PCs DR10, enemies DR12. Track effects and rounds manually."],
[&"", &"Pick pockets and locks with an Agility DR8 test. Begin with lockpicks."]: [&"Pick pockets and locks with an Agility DR8 test. Begin with lockpicks."],
[&"", &"When attacking by surprise, test Agility DR10. Success automatically hits once with a light one-handed weapon for normal damage +3."]: [&"When attacking by surprise, test Agility DR10. Success automatically hits once with a light one-handed weapon for normal damage +3."],
[&"", &"Educated by outlaws in a hovel south of Alliáns."]: [&"Educated by outlaws in a hovel south of Alliáns."],
[&"", &"Escaped the Tvelandian orphanarium."]: [&"Escaped the Tvelandian orphanarium."],
[&"", &"Kicked and beaten beneath a baker’s table in Schleswig."]: [&"Kicked and beaten beneath a baker’s table in Schleswig."],
[&"", &"Raised by rats in the gutters of Grift."]: [&"Raised by rats in the gutters of Grift."],
[&"", &"Mother hanged from a tree outside Galgenbeck; you fell from the corpse."]: [&"Mother hanged from a tree outside Galgenbeck; you fell from the corpse."],
[&"", &"Dumped onto a moving shit-cart still in your birth caul."]: [&"Dumped onto a moving shit-cart still in your birth caul."],
[&"", &"On first getting better, roll another specialty. From the second improvement, you may reroll either or both specialties; resolve improvements at the table."]: [&"On first getting better, roll another specialty. From the second improvement, you may reroll either or both specialties; resolve improvements at the table."],
[&"", &"All Presence and Agility tests have their DR reduced by 2 (normal tests DR10)."]: [&"All Presence and Agility tests have their DR reduced by 2 (normal tests DR10)."],
[&"", &"Attack DR10, d4 damage. A 1-in-6 chance instantly kills small-to-medium creatures. Returns to the wielder."]: [&"Attack DR10, d4 damage. A 1-in-6 chance instantly kills small-to-medium creatures. Returns to the wielder."],
[&"", &"Sniffs out treasure in debris. Frenzied around goblins and berserkers."]: [&"Sniffs out treasure in debris. Frenzied around goblins and berserkers."],
[&"", &"Sniffs out treasure in debris. Bite d6, attack DR10, defence DR12, HP 10. Frenzied around goblins and berserkers."]: [&"Sniffs out treasure in debris. Bite d6, attack DR10, defence DR12, HP 10. Frenzied around goblins and berserkers."],
[&"", &"2d4 damage; uses fist-sized rocks."]: [&"2d4 damage; uses fist-sized rocks."],
[&"", &"Four teeth. Before battle roll d6 for each; each 6 makes one attack deal maximum damage. The table tracks these benefits."]: [&"Four teeth. Before battle roll d6 for each; each 6 makes one attack deal maximum damage. The table tracks these benefits."],
[&"", &"d6 damage; attack and defence DR10 while wielded. A wounded enemy has a 1-in-6 chance of sepsis and death in 10 minutes; track that consequence manually."]: [&"d6 damage; attack and defence DR10 while wielded. A wounded enemy has a 1-in-6 chance of sepsis and death in 10 minutes; track that consequence manually."],
[&"", &"While worn, lesser creatures such as goblins, gnoums and children check Morale every round. Resolve these ongoing checks manually."]: [&"While worn, lesser creatures such as goblins, gnoums and children check Morale every round. Resolve these ongoing checks manually."],
